							"settings": {
								"title": "From Ken",
								"header_size": "p",
								"_css_classes": "eyebrow"
							},
							"elements": []
						},
						{
							"id": "5c24c5b",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "text-editor",
							"settings": {
								"editor": "<p>I started Brother Tours in 2018 after eight years of guiding other people's itineraries. The reason was simple: the best days were always the ones nobody had planned, and I could not build those into someone else's schedule.</p>\n<p>When I host a journey I am not adding a layer of service. I am removing the layer between you and the country — the second-hand explanation, the fixed route, the guide who is following a brief. You get the version I would travel myself.</p>",
								"_css_classes": "bt-landing-insight__body"
							},
							"elements": []
						},
						{
							"id": "c2394ba",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "text-editor",
							"settings": {
								"editor": "<p>Ken FJ Her — founder, Brother Tours. Licensed Lao National Tour Guide since 2010; founded Brother Tours in 2018.</p>",
								"_css_classes": "bt-landing-insight__attribution"
							},
							"elements": []
						}
