						},
						{
							"id": "3031a16",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "html",
							"settings": {
								"html": "<ol class=\"bt-landing-steps\"><li class=\"bt-landing-step\"><span class=\"bt-landing-step__n\">01</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__title\">Tell us about your trip</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__body\">Dates, pace, who is travelling, what you want the days to feel like.</span></li><li class=\"bt-landing-step\"><span class=\"bt-landing-step__n\">02</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__title\">Brother Tours designs the journey</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__body\">A route built around your answers, not assembled from a package shelf.</span></li><li class=\"bt-landing-step\"><span class=\"bt-landing-step__n\">03</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__title\">Review and refine</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__body\">Change anything. Most journeys go through two or three rounds before they settle.</span></li><li class=\"bt-landing-step\"><span class=\"bt-landing-step__n\">04</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__title\">Human confirmation</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__body\">Every element is confirmed with the people who will actually deliver it.</span></li><li class=\"bt-landing-step\"><span class=\"bt-landing-step__n\">05</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__title\">Travel Laos</span><span class=\"bt-landing-step__body\">Your guide, your driver, your itinerary — and someone reachable in Vientiane throughout.</span></li></ol>"
							},
